      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "I used AI to get ideas for how to integrate AI into the app. Started by explaining the app to ChatGPT, then asked how AI could be integrated.",
